    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "乘法对于加法的分配律对任何数都成立. 在化简式子和求式子的值时应用这个定律.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 231,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0240#9",
        "p0241#1"
      ],
      "source_text": "乘法对于加法的分配律对任何数都成立. 在化简式子和求式子的值时应用这个定律.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例1. 求$\\left(\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{3}{5}\\right)\\cdot10$的值：\n$\\left(\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{3}{5}\\right)\\cdot10=\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot10+\\frac{3}{5}\\cdot10=5+6=11$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 232,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0241#2"
      ],
      "source_text": "例1. 求$\\left(\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{3}{5}\\right)\\cdot10$的值：$\\left(\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{3}{5}\\right)\\cdot10=\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot10+\\frac{3}{5}\\cdot10=5+6=11$.",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例2. 如果$x=3\\frac{1}{3}$，求$-\\frac{3}{5}x+\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{7}{10}x+\\frac{3}{4}$的值.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 232,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0241#3"
      ],
      "source_text": "例2. 如果$x=3\\frac{1}{3}$，求$-\\frac{3}{5}x+\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{7}{10}x+\\frac{3}{4}$的值.",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "应用分配律可以合并同类项：\n$-\\frac{3}{5}x+\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{7}{10}x+\\frac{3}{4}=\\left(-\\frac{3}{5}+\\frac{7}{10}\\right)x+\\left(\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{3}{4}\\right)=\\frac{1}{10}x+1\\frac{1}{4}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 232,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0241#4"
      ],
      "source_text": "应用分配律可以合并同类项：$-\\frac{3}{5}x+\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{7}{10}x+\\frac{3}{4}=\\left(-\\frac{3}{5}+\\frac{7}{10}\\right)x+\\left(\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{3}{4}\\right)=\\frac{1}{10}x+1\\frac{1}{4}$.",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "现在我们求上式在$x=3\\frac{1}{3}$时的值：\n$\\frac{1}{10}x+1\\frac{1}{4}=\\frac{1}{10}\\cdot3\\frac{1}{3}+1\\frac{1}{4}=\\frac{1}{10}\\cdot\\frac{10}{3}+1\\frac{1}{4}=\\frac{1}{3}+1\\frac{1}{4}=1+\\frac{1}{3}+\\frac{1}{4}=1+\\frac{4}{12}+\\frac{3}{12}=1\\frac{7}{12}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 232,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0241#5"
      ],
      "source_text": "现在我们求上式在$x=3\\frac{1}{3}$时的值：$\\frac{1}{10}x+1\\frac{1}{4}=\\frac{1}{10}\\cdot3\\frac{1}{3}+1\\frac{1}{4}=\\frac{1}{10}\\cdot\\frac{10}{3}+1\\frac{1}{4}=\\frac{1}{3}+1\\frac{1}{4}=1+\\frac{1}{3}+\\frac{1}{4}=1+\\frac{4}{12}+\\frac{3}{12}=1\\frac{7}{12}$.",
      "changes": [
